# Placeholder values only. Never commit real values.
#
# Local Worker variables go in `.dev.vars` (git-ignored); see `.dev.vars.example`
# and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md. Production values must be set in the Cloudflare
# dashboard or with `wrangler secret put`, never in this file.
#
# Local development only (admin Worker dev server; ignored by production builds):
# ADMIN_DEV_IDENTITY_EMAIL=dev@example.test
#
# Admin Worker, deployed environments (Cloudflare Access JWT validation; not
# secrets, but environment-specific). Without them the admin API returns 403.
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=https://<your-team-name>.cloudflareaccess.com
# ACCESS_POLICY_AUD=<application-audience-tag>
